# Contaminated Landscape: "{T}, Sacrifice this land: Search your library for a basic Plains, Island, or Swamp card, put
# it onto the battlefield tapped, then shuffle." A Tundra has the Plains and Island types but is not basic (CR 205.4a),
# so it is not a card the search may find; the Plains is, and enters tapped.

[Bot1 Deck]
Contaminated Landscape
Forest x6
Plains x2
Tundra
Swamp
Island
Forest x8

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Contaminated Landscape.Play
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Contaminated Landscape.Activate(Ability: {T}, Sacrifice this land)
! Bot1.Search(Tundra)
Bot1.Search(Plains)

[Expect]
Bot1.Graveyard = Contaminated Landscape
Bot1.Battlefield.Plains.Tapped = true
